        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:#444;font-size:14px;">Rearranging words doesn't fix a dangling participle — the sentence needs the correct subject placed right after the comma.</p>
        <p style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#c0392b;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;">Wrong: Reading the notice, it seemed urgent to the staff.</p>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:#27ae60;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;">Correct: Reading the notice, the staff felt it seemed urgent.</p>
